; Derivation (properties are facts on the edge): Edwin's `present` edge to carnath
; has disguised=true asserted -250, retracted -220, replaced by disguised=false
; asserted -220 (tx4). Mara's `present` edge to graymoor has disguised=false
; asserted -190. No other edge has the property. Rows sort false before true, then
; by tick.
[:find ?d ?t ?op :where [?e :disguised ?d ?t ?op]]
